<h1 align="center">Stalwart Helm chart</h1>

<p align="center">
  Run the <a href="https://stalw.art">Stalwart</a> mail and collaboration server on Kubernetes,<br>
  with optional <a href="https://bulwarkmail.org">Bulwark</a> webmail.
</p>

